# LF working trees on every platform. The Windows release job checks out with
# core.autocrlf=true (runner-image default); CRLF working trees break the
# source-scanning test invariants (literal "\n" matches) and change source
# bytes out from under provenance measurements. S160.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
